nt 6» de Georgia y Luisiana es la escuela pop más influyente de la década: Apples In Stereo, Olivia Tremor Control, Neutral Milk Hotel (In The Aeroplane Over The Sea), Elf Power, Of Montreal; y sus herederos Ladybug Transistor y Photon Band. El folk-pop a lo Tom Petty y R.E.M.; el «lounge-pop» (Combustible Edison, Zumpano, Ivy, Cardigans, Squirrel Nut Zippers); el teen-pop (Hanson, Britney Spears, Backstreet Boys).","color":"#f472b6","family":"Pop, power-pop y synth-pop","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#pop-90s"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":105927139936099,"artist":"Olivia Tremor Control","artist_id":119779297713391,"title":"Dusk at Cubist Castle","year":1996,"ess":0,"yt":"0B8DSC-1MmY","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Renacimiento pop, Elephant 6 y lounge-pop","scene_id":176801568845576,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#pop-90s","chapters":["Sección 6.11"],"pages":[[1,270,null]]},{"id":275356889740464,"artist":"Olivia Tremor Control","artist_id":119779297713391,"title":"Black Foliage","year":1999,"ess":0,"yt":"jFTfMs6obi0","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Renacimiento pop, Elephant 6 y lounge-pop","scene_id":176801568845576,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#pop-90s","chapters":["Sección 6.11"],"pages":[[1,270,null]]}],"mentions":[{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":270,"text":"…this generation: the songs on Tone Soul Evolution (1997) were miracles of pop metabolism, incorporating one century of melodic tricks. Will Hart's Olivia Tremor Control (2) struck an elegant balance between retro' Sixties sound and state-of-the-art production techniques on Dusk at Cubist Castle (1996) and Black…"}],"podcast":[],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[{"kind":"xref",